<title>UK: United News takes over 50pct control of HTV.</title>
<headline>United News takes over 50pct control of HTV.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United News &amp; Media Plc on Friday took control of more than 50 percent of HTV Group Plc after launching an agreed 371.7 million pound bid for the regional broadcaster.</p>
<p>United had agreed to buy another 18.8 million HTV shares, or about 21.2 percent, which in aggregrate with its existing stake takes its shareholding to around 51 percent, HTV said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4020</p>
